{"id":"e4a21ca3b3930018","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-resolvent.md","title":"Resolvent of a binary feasible set","display":"df-resolvent — Resolvent of a binary feasible set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-resolvent","aliases":["27-df-resolvent"],"display":"df-resolvent — Resolvent of a binary feasible set","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]","[[27-df-real]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.13.6","source_printed_pages":"62","source_pdf_pages":"86","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-resolvent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-resolvent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolvent — Resolvent of a binary feasible set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dcab93ecb7af658c\" href=\"?note=dcab93ecb7af658c\" title=\"27-df-real\">27-df-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.13.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"62"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"86"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 及布尔向量的坐标域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>。实标量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dcab93ecb7af658c\" href=\"?note=dcab93ecb7af658c\" title=\"27-df-real\">27-df-real</a>。可行集可以为空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname*{argmax}\">\\(\\operatorname*{argmax}\\)</span> 在下式以集合构造定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in U}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in U\\mid\\forall b\\in U\\;\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i\\geq\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i b_i\\right)\\right\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in U}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in U\\mid\\forall b\\in U\\;\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i\\geq\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i b_i\\right)\\right\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_F(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;a\\in F,\\\\1,&amp;a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus F.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_F(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;a\\in F,\\\\1,&amp;a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus F.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid r_F(a)=0\\},\\qquad\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in F}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i=\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\,r_F(a)=0}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid r_F(a)=0\\},\\qquad\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in F}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i=\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\,r_F(a)=0}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书称把不可行点取为 1 的函数为 resolvent。分支覆盖整个布尔立方体且不相交，故它是唯一全函数。该编码把任意二值可行性限制统一成一个零方程，特别注意不能把它误写成 F 的通常取值为 1 的示性函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-real","status":"resolved","id":"dcab93ecb7af658c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-real","status":"resolved","id":"dcab93ecb7af658c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$c\\in\\mathbb R^n$。实标量见 [[27-df-real]]。可行集可以为空；$\\operatorname*{argmax}$ 在下式以集合构造定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname*{argmax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in U}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in U\\mid\\forall b\\in U\\;\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i\\geq\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i b_i\\right)\\right\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"r_F(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&a\\in F,\\\\1,&a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus F.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"F=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid r_F(a)=0\\},\\qquad\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in F}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i=\\operatorname*{argmax}_{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\,r_F(a)=0}\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i a_i.","display":true}],"bytes":1859,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-resolvent|df-resolvent — Resolvent of a binary feasible set]]"},{"id":"2ec0bac4674c9e87","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$m\\in\\mathbb N$，$F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$r_F$ 见 [[27-df-resolvent]]。$A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])$，$A_k=A(k)$、$B_k=B(k)$，且 $\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing)$。假定 $\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(r_F(a)=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}))$。$c\\in\\mathbb R^n$。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828","dcab93ecb7af658c"]}